II. RESTRICTIVE ADDENDUM (THE "PLAYGROUND" & "POISON PILL" CLAUSES)

1.  COMMERCIAL USE PROHIBITION ("The Playground Clause")
    Notwithstanding the grant of rights in the Standard Apache 2.0 Terms,
    NO RIGHT is granted for any "Commercial Use".
    "Commercial Use" includes, but is not limited to:
    (a) Use of the Software in a production environment.
    (b) Use of the Software to provide services to third parties (SaaS).
    (c) Integrating the Software into a product for which a fee is charged.
    (d) Use by any commercial entity for purposes other than internal testing/evaluation.

    The License granted strictly allows for "Playground Use" (testing,
    experimentation, education, and development) ONLY.

2.  LITIGATION TERMINATION ("The Facebook/React Clause")
    The license granted hereunder will terminate, automatically and without notice,
    if you (or any of your subsidiaries, corporate affiliates or agents):
    (a) Initiate directly or indirectly, or take a direct financial interest in,
    any Patent Assertion: (i) against the Licensor or any Contributor,
    (ii) constituting a direct or contributory infringement claim.
    (b) Initiate any legal action claiming that the Software constitutes
    commercial infringement or unfair competition.

3.  SEVERABILITY AND PRECEDENCE
    In the event of a conflict between the Standard Apache 2.0 Terms and this
    Restrictive Addendum, the **Restrictive Addendum shall control**.
    Any use of the Software in violation of these restrictions constitutes
    unlicensed usage and immediate breach of contract, subject to all
    legal remedies available under applicable law.

4.  ACCEPTANCE
    By downloading, accessing, or using the Software, you irrevocably accept
    these Hybrid Terms. If you do not agree to the Commercial Prohibition
    or the Litigation Termination clause, you have NO RIGHTS to use the Software.

